WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.980
<b><i>We look the same, but men call us monsters. 

00:02:19.070 --> 00:02:23.990
<b>The Massive Castle Rumbles</b>

00:02:24.530 --> 00:02:28.260
At last... At last, we're going, yes?

00:02:29.390 --> 00:02:30.500
To Edo.

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:34.250
To Chiyoda Castle.

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:05.280
It stopped?

00:03:24.810 --> 00:03:26.430
Namenba, look!

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:28.180
Yeah.

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:30.010
That's her, all right...

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:32.190
Hibiki.

00:03:43.770 --> 00:03:44.590
Look.

00:03:50.030 --> 00:03:51.040
Three of them.

00:03:53.840 --> 00:03:55.840
Three over there, too.

00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:57.930
We'll be in trouble if they 
call for reinforcements.

00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:00.760
Got it.

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:31.160
You again?

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:33.920
That isn't a very friendly greeting.

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:36.040
You aren't going to thank me?

00:04:36.550 --> 00:04:40.140
You helped us because you want something.

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:42.690
However, you did save us.

00:04:43.110 --> 00:04:43.800
Let's go.

00:04:44.030 --> 00:04:45.430
Wait.

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:53.060
Far more Rain are waiting around that castle.

00:04:53.690 --> 00:04:55.720
Will you charge them,

00:04:55.720 --> 00:04:58.310
just the two of you, without even 
knowing how many?

00:04:58.740 --> 00:05:00.350
Nobody asked you.

00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:03.190
No... Let's go.

00:05:03.980 --> 00:05:07.390
Namenba-dono and I are of the same mind.

00:05:07.390 --> 00:05:09.660
Let us ready our weapons and return.

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:11.760
We should tell Gorone, as well.

00:05:12.150 --> 00:05:15.090
May I go with you to talk to him?

00:05:15.090 --> 00:05:16.460
Nope!

00:05:16.850 --> 00:05:19.260
We don't trust you.

00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:23.120
Why do you always show up at 
the perfect moment, anyway?

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:25.220
It was the same at Edo Castle.

00:05:25.940 --> 00:05:31.220
Doesn't every man want to 
show off for a girl he likes?

00:05:32.830 --> 00:05:34.430
Let's go, Hachisu.

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:34.980
Yeah.

00:05:57.310 --> 00:05:58.400
I see...

00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:02.380
She entered that new Murakumo?

00:06:02.580 --> 00:06:03.970
We were careless.

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:07.260
Utsutsu and Rui were there, 
but she lost them.

00:06:08.020 --> 00:06:10.440
No, no matter how many we were,

00:06:10.440 --> 00:06:14.130
if Hibiki really attacked us 
while under mind control,

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:16.390
no one could defeat her.

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:19.030
Except Hachirou...

00:06:20.570 --> 00:06:23.270
The new Murakumo is moving, yes?

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:28.190
It's moving about half the 
speed that a man walks.

00:06:28.190 --> 00:06:29.780
We can catch up quickly.

00:06:30.180 --> 00:06:31.530
Then, wait.

00:06:33.230 --> 00:06:35.590
Don't try to go on your own.

00:06:36.180 --> 00:06:37.810
I know.

00:06:37.810 --> 00:06:40.350
But it's our leader who was kidnapped.

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:18.830
I can't wait!

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:20.830
You guys...

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:23.080
Is it okay for you to be up yet?

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:24.750
I'm fine...

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:26.740
Just a little numb.

00:07:26.740 --> 00:07:30.150
We were with her, and this still happened.

00:07:30.150 --> 00:07:33.650
Even though we've spent our whole 
lives, told to protect our leader.

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:36.550
Wait for everyone?

00:07:36.550 --> 00:07:37.970
Give me a break.

00:07:40.590 --> 00:07:43.480
I can't bear to face them...

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:47.480
Don't try to act, based on fleeting feelings.

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:52.380
Let them, Gorone.

00:07:53.630 --> 00:07:56.990
I think I feel the same way.

00:07:56.990 --> 00:08:00.750
I'm worried, even if we 
can catch up quickly.

00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:06.500
Since living together, they've never 
been separated from her.

00:08:09.140 --> 00:08:10.510
Please.

00:08:13.040 --> 00:08:14.390
Very well.

00:08:15.910 --> 00:08:18.440
But you'll need more firepower.

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:22.050
I'll have it ready by dawn.

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:26.400
<b>Edo Castle</b>

00:08:28.030 --> 00:08:30.790
That castle has appeared once more?

00:08:30.790 --> 00:08:33.620
That is what the Kurokuwa messenger says.

00:08:33.620 --> 00:08:35.310
And that it's moving.

00:08:35.310 --> 00:08:36.630
Impossible...

00:08:36.630 --> 00:08:40.710
How much can we believe in this "messenger"?

00:08:40.710 --> 00:08:41.820
To the east...

00:08:43.190 --> 00:08:46.670
He says it's heading east, to Edo.

00:08:47.140 --> 00:08:52.170
Tenkai, were you lying when you said 
it was destroyed and disappeared?

00:08:52.790 --> 00:08:55.540
I was not.

00:08:55.540 --> 00:09:01.430
But I said nothing about the Joujinshuu 
themselves disappearing.

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:04.940
You would split hairs, even now?

00:09:05.280 --> 00:09:08.150
Remain calm, Your Excellency.

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:13.190
Even if that castle is truly moving,

00:09:13.560 --> 00:09:19.200
we have much time before it reaches Edo.

00:09:19.820 --> 00:09:22.700
Before it does, I promise...

00:09:23.180 --> 00:09:26.030
I can believe you, right?

00:09:26.820 --> 00:09:30.210
That this time, you'll defeat them?

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:35.220
What's wrong?

00:09:37.670 --> 00:09:40.470
Fascinating...

00:09:41.380 --> 00:09:42.220
What?

00:09:43.950 --> 00:09:51.980
I never expected the seeds of fate 
to change my life, as well.

00:09:52.720 --> 00:09:59.490
But I will not let them lay a 
finger on it, as long I live.

00:09:59.980 --> 00:10:06.250
On the peace that your ancestor 
Ieyasu-sama created...

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:13.210
These are all we've got.

00:10:13.950 --> 00:10:15.310
Let's take it all.

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:18.470
We can't take them all. So many...

00:10:18.910 --> 00:10:21.010
Let's take as many as we can.

00:10:21.710 --> 00:10:24.260
I doubt we'll have enough, 
no matter how many we bring.

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:31.090
It's been a while, but I guess I'll go, too.

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:35.350
A silly joke.

00:10:35.350 --> 00:10:38.150
Of course I can't, and wouldn't want, to go.

00:10:56.600 --> 00:10:57.800
How about a persimmon?

00:11:05.270 --> 00:11:06.460
No, thank you.

00:11:06.460 --> 00:11:09.270
Take one, Namenba-dono.

00:11:10.290 --> 00:11:13.270
Perhaps, someday, we'll have known 
each other for a long time.

00:11:14.170 --> 00:11:17.010
How... did you know it was me?

00:11:23.590 --> 00:11:25.960
Your face looks tired,

00:11:25.960 --> 00:11:28.750
but there's no sweat on your brow.

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:32.690
You're trying to pass as 
a girl from the town,

00:11:32.690 --> 00:11:35.120
but you don't quite pull it off.

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:37.670
Then, you are...

00:11:40.110 --> 00:11:42.630
I'm sorry, but could you help me up?

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:47.890
I could see it on your face.

00:11:48.620 --> 00:11:52.440
"I have to work with a weakling like this,

00:11:52.440 --> 00:11:56.400
who can't even walk?"

00:11:56.590 --> 00:11:57.900
I wasn't...

00:11:58.400 --> 00:12:02.150
Okay, that's all of it.

00:12:04.770 --> 00:12:09.950
If I'd been just a normal girl from town,

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:13.290
I'd have spent my whole 
life taking care of you.

00:12:13.900 --> 00:12:16.040
Would that have been bad?

00:12:20.250 --> 00:12:21.390
Yeah...

00:12:23.240 --> 00:12:25.710
I would have been sick of it.

00:12:26.170 --> 00:12:29.390
We really have known each other a long time.

00:12:42.790 --> 00:12:44.780
It really is slow.

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:48.080
It's moving, but it's as slow as a turtle.

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:48.860
Yeah.

00:12:49.720 --> 00:12:53.710
We can't use the robe to 
get inside from above?

00:12:54.180 --> 00:12:56.160
We'd be too visible.

00:12:56.160 --> 00:12:59.190
We'll enter from below 
and climb up the walls.

00:12:59.870 --> 00:13:01.460
It's the only way.

00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:04.480
Hachisu, we'll head around, to its front.

00:13:07.770 --> 00:13:10.150
I'll take out any Rain that gets in our way.

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:18.650
<i>It's begun.</i>

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:31.130
No good?

00:14:31.500 --> 00:14:32.950
Let's head back, for now.

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:45.320
You?

00:14:48.430 --> 00:14:49.630
It isn't stopping!

00:14:49.630 --> 00:14:52.700
No, I should have known 
it wouldn't be that easy.

00:14:55.840 --> 00:14:59.460
And there's no end to the Rain, as usual.

00:14:59.950 --> 00:15:04.120
That explosive is quite powerful.

00:15:04.740 --> 00:15:07.590
Is that one of Gorone-dono's creations?

00:15:07.910 --> 00:15:09.560
What are you trying to say?

00:15:09.560 --> 00:15:12.590
We have no time to waste with you, right now!

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:17.600
But even that won't be able 
to stop the Murakumo.

00:15:18.070 --> 00:15:19.980
Did you come to laugh at that?!

00:15:20.400 --> 00:15:22.730
Now, now. Wait...

00:15:23.050 --> 00:15:26.550
You want the leader of the Five Flowers,

00:15:26.550 --> 00:15:30.740
Iga Hibiki-dono, back in your hands.

00:15:32.260 --> 00:15:33.970
And I am the same.

00:15:33.970 --> 00:15:37.870
I want Tadanaga-sama back, too.

00:15:38.320 --> 00:15:42.770
If we want the same things, there is no 
reason for us not to work together.

00:15:43.660 --> 00:15:44.720
How about it?

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:25.760
First, I'll scale the Murakumo's 
walls and find a way inside.

00:16:27.860 --> 00:16:31.890
You two, follow me.

00:16:32.570 --> 00:16:37.180
And we're supposed to help 
you until you're inside?

00:16:38.070 --> 00:16:39.060
Yes.

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:42.960
Listen, if you get inside first,

00:16:42.960 --> 00:16:46.310
you're going to help us find our leader.

00:16:47.120 --> 00:16:49.190
Then, I shall ask something.

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:53.140
If you can find Hibiki-dono,

00:16:53.140 --> 00:16:57.320
Namenba-dono, please be my woman.

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:09.070
Looks like quite the guy has fallen for you.

00:17:09.070 --> 00:17:10.350
Hachisu,

00:17:10.350 --> 00:17:13.840
we're helping that perverted monk! Let's go!

00:17:31.820 --> 00:17:38.120
<i>Roll the dice, roll the day.</i>

00:17:38.610 --> 00:17:41.620
<i>And dream, and dream,</i>

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:44.720
<i>and then...</i>

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:52.230
<i>Someday, my body will rot.</i>

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:02.890
That song is too sad to give you any coins.

00:18:11.760 --> 00:18:14.480
I am uninterested in your coins.

00:18:14.480 --> 00:18:16.180
You're with the Joujinshuu?

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:20.290
You still cannot remember my name?

00:18:21.020 --> 00:18:23.390
It's Yasha Itaru.

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:26.620
Someday, I will have to kill you.

00:18:27.450 --> 00:18:29.440
If I don't know it, I'll feel no sympathy.

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:32.810
Oh, how violent...

00:18:32.810 --> 00:18:35.850
It seems you're in a hurry to head east.

00:18:36.450 --> 00:18:39.180
Then, you've already heard, haven't you?

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:41.220
About the Murakumo.

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:42.680
Yes.

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:45.620
I shall take you there.

00:18:45.620 --> 00:18:51.940
If you like, I can take you into 
the Murakumo, at once.

00:18:52.470 --> 00:18:55.210
I've heard that nonsense many times.

00:18:55.210 --> 00:18:56.080
I refuse.

00:18:56.690 --> 00:18:58.070
You believe it a trap?

00:18:58.070 --> 00:18:59.890
Are you afraid?

00:19:01.780 --> 00:19:03.100
Pathetic...

00:19:03.100 --> 00:19:05.950
Placing your own survival 
first, Kouga Hachirou?

00:19:06.270 --> 00:19:08.790
You refuse to save Iga Hibiki?

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:12.210
What?!

00:19:21.080 --> 00:19:23.400
Then, you didn't know...

00:19:23.400 --> 00:19:26.470
Iga Hibiki has fallen into our hands.

00:20:13.680 --> 00:20:19.530
You cannot look away from my mirror, can you?

00:20:22.620 --> 00:20:28.130
Your eyes can do nothing against a mirror.

00:20:28.600 --> 00:20:32.790
Unless you want to kill yourself.

00:20:33.430 --> 00:20:35.290
Do not worry...

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:38.080
I shan't use Destiny's Passage.

00:20:38.530 --> 00:20:41.050
That was Joujin-sama's order.

00:20:41.440 --> 00:20:48.060
But I can change your desire to refuse me.

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:51.340
Now, come...

00:20:51.690 --> 00:20:55.500
Do you not wish to save Iga Hibiki?

00:21:13.570 --> 00:21:14.900
Hibiki...

00:21:15.930 --> 00:21:16.960
Hibiki.

00:21:18.350 --> 00:21:19.320
Hibiki!

00:21:43.850 --> 00:21:44.950
Hibiki...

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:27.010
<b><i>Preview</i></b>

00:23:26.090 --> 00:23:29.470
The world of man is a world of war.

00:23:29.760 --> 00:23:36.000
But that young girl, with the deep 
sadness her eyepatch hides...

00:23:35.260 --> 00:23:38.270
<b><i>Everyone Gathers at the Battlefield</i></b>

00:23:36.380 --> 00:23:39.020
She almost never speaks.
